<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 01:56:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>国会功能失调且不负责任，自二战以来只完成了四次职责</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/congress-dysfunction-national-debt-august-recess-appropriations-bills/</link><description>联邦政府 7 月份的赤字达到创纪录的 4,320 亿美元，8 月份的总债务达到 40 万亿美元的门槛——国会暂停了。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295080827-e1789657688320.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:09:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/congress-dysfunction-national-debt-august-recess-appropriations-bills/</guid></item><item><title>随着人工智能首席执行官在监管问题上发生冲突，一场新的文化战争正在酝酿</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/as-ai-ceos-clash-over-regulation-a-new-culture-war-is-brewing/</link><description>科技领导人在谁应该监管先进人工智能的问题上存在分歧，而特朗普政府及其盟友正在煽动一场文化战争。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gettyimages-2281423992-594x594-1.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 19:20:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/as-ai-ceos-clash-over-regulation-a-new-culture-war-is-brewing/</guid></item><item><title>Shopify首席执行官表示，员工的“手榴弹”正在给其他人带来更多工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/shopify-tobias-lutke-ai-slop-grenades/</link><description>他说人工智能正在帮助工人生产更多产出，但其质量太差，以至于他们的同事不得不花更多时间来修复它&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2277835594-e1789680318151.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:33:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/shopify-tobias-lutke-ai-slop-grenades/</guid></item><item><title>独家：OpenAI 从 SpaceX 挖来 Brian McCarthy 担任其全球销售副总裁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/openai-poache-brian-mccarthy-from-spacex-as-its-vp-of-worldwide-sales/</link><description>McCarthy 是 OpenAI 的新 CRO Dali Rajic 的第一位主要雇员，他于不到一个月前加入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Edited-Horizontal-of-Brian.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 19:30:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/openai-poache-brian-mccarthy-from-spacex-as-its-vp-of-worldwide-sales/</guid></item><item><title>像彼得·泰尔这样的全球富豪正在虎视眈眈地寻找出口。阿根廷希望成为移民游戏中的“有力竞争者”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/16/the-global-rich-peter-thiel-safe-haven-argentina/</link><description>即将推出的投资入籍计划可能会使阿根廷成为超级富豪对冲国内风险的下一个后备计划&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2284934331-e1784219965932.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 16:58:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/16/the-global-rich-peter-thiel-safe-haven-argentina/</guid></item><item><title>油价重回 100 美元上方，但经济学家表示这个数字并不是对美国经济的真正威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/oil-above-100-us-economy-gas-diesel-prices/</link><description>天然气所占的家庭收入比以前有所减少，但创纪录的柴油价格和炼油厂短缺仍可能抑制支出。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294263295-e1789673107851.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 19:39:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/oil-above-100-us-economy-gas-diesel-prices/</guid></item><item><title>“我们需要足够的控制手段，以免一切都太晚了”：查理三世国王警告人工智能玩家担心“存在的危险”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/king-charles-ai-existential-dangers-control/</link><description>随着人们越来越担心人工智能可能逃脱人类的控制，英国君主召集了来自 OpenAI、Nvidia、Anthropic 和 Google DeepMind 的领导人。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26260432301599-e1789672199538.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 19:28:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/king-charles-ai-existential-dangers-control/</guid></item><item><title>高盛首席策略师刚刚在其盈利泡沫警告中添加了硬性数据</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/goldman-oppenheimer-earnings-bubble-hard-data/</link><description>彼得·奥本海默 (Peter Oppenheimer) 首先指出了今年夏天人工智能股票面临不可持续盈利繁荣的风险。他做了更多的数学题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2252015661-e1789659906680.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:45:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/goldman-oppenheimer-earnings-bubble-hard-data/</guid></item><item><title>自 2022 年以来，被人工智能专业拒之门外的大学毕业生最终进入了零售和食品服务业，而不是他们学习的白领工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/ai-chatgpt-college-majors-retail-jobs/</link><description>ChatGPT 后，入门级招聘枯竭，这些领域的毕业生转而接受工资较低的服务工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1307765195-e1789662907220.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:28:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/ai-chatgpt-college-majors-retail-jobs/</guid></item><item><title>帮助缓解霍尔木兹冲击的关键管道刚刚关闭：以下是它揭示的企业能源安全信息</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/strait-of-hormuz-energy-supply-chain-risk-iran/</link><description>霍尔木兹海峡危机为管理能源中断和供应链风险提供了一本商业手册。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294601588-e1789668316387.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:19:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/17/strait-of-hormuz-energy-supply-chain-risk-iran/</guid></item></channel></rss>